<figure class="cache-figure" data-pending-cache-read>
 <p class="figure-title">An invalidation can cancel a fill that has not arrived yet</p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><button data-next>Next reply step</button><button data-reset>Reset pending read</button></div>
 <ol class="pending-events"><li data-event="1">Send GET · remember pending token 0</li><li data-event="2">Key changes · invalidation arrives before the old reply</li><li data-event="3">Old GET reply arrives: 12</li></ol>
 <div class="recovery-pair"><div class="recovery-node"><b>Always install replies</b><strong data-naive>Empty</strong><small>Local cached value</small></div><div class="recovery-node"><b>Check pending token</b><strong data-guarded>Empty</strong><small data-token>No read in progress</small></div></div>
 <p class="cluster-command" data-caller></p><p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>This ordering models separate data and invalidation connections. One RESP3 connection preserves wire order and does not have this particular cross-connection reordering. A custom asynchronous cache must also avoid installing a result after its pending entry has been invalidated. The guard protects future cache reads; it does not retroactively change the old result received by the current request.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import{pendingInitial,pendingStep}from'../../lib/caching/tracking.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-pending-cache-read]').forEach(root=>{let s=pendingInitial();const render=()=>{root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-event]').forEach(el=>{const i=Number(el.dataset.event);el.classList.toggle('complete',i<=s.phase);el.classList.toggle('current',i===s.phase);});root.querySelector('[data-naive]')!.textContent=String(s.naive??'Empty');root.querySelector('[data-guarded]')!.textContent=String(s.guarded??'Empty');root.querySelector('[data-token]')!.textContent=s.phase===0?'No read in progress':`Pending token ${s.token} · current generation ${s.epoch}`;root.querySelector('[data-caller]')!.textContent=s.reply===null?'The original request has no reply yet':'The original request receives 12 in both cases';root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=['Start a read. The guarded cache records which pending operation is allowed to install its result.','The GET is in flight. Neither local cache has a value yet.','The invalidation clears any value and invalidates the pending token. Simply deleting an empty cache entry would leave no memory of this event.','The naive cache stores the late 12. The guarded cache sees that token 0 no longer matches generation 1 and leaves the local entry empty.'][s.phase];root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-next]')!.disabled=s.phase===3;};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-next]')!.onclick=()=>{s=pendingStep(s);render();};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.onclick=()=>{s=pendingInitial();render();};render();});
</script>
